7
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:56,900
balance of power remains identical. No country becomes more vulnerable.

8
00:00:57,860 --> 00:01:07,540
Three. The Prize: That one percent, a twenty-seven point two billion dollar a year river of cash, is redirected to cure

9
00:01:07,540 --> 00:01:15,660
all human diseases. For comparison, twenty-seven point two billion dollars is about what Americans spend on Valentine's

10
00:01:15,660 --> 00:01:22,620
Day (flowers and chocolate more than curing cancer, apparently), and roughly what humans spend on pet food every three months.

11
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:27,260
Apparently too much to ask for curing diseases. How It Works.

12
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:35,800
One. Funding: Creates a twenty-seven point two billion dollar per year revenue stream for the one percent Treaty Fund.

13
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:45,400
