Wishocracy. Four. Transparency: All research, data, and spending published on public ledger.

17
00:02:10,160 --> 00:02:16,960
This Isn't a Trade-Off. It's like if everyone in your neighborhood spent their life savings on attack dogs, and then called

18
00:02:16,960 --> 00:02:20,310
